5
00:00:29,947 --> 00:00:31,531
<i>De la Tercera Era.</i>

6
00:00:32,575 --> 00:00:34,451
<i>De una nueva era.</i>

7
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:41,583
<i>El nacimiento de la Alianza Interestelar.</i>

8
00:00:42,251 --> 00:00:43,710
